Subject: [PATCH 110/121] moe router: packed-key softmax top-k
 (SGLANG_ROUTER_FAST_TOPK=1, default off)

One int64 max per pick instead of three dependent warp reductions; row max/sum and
the routed-sum order are the Triton router's, so weights and ids are bit-identical
(flash-next-bench bench/rt1/route_bench.py --check).

